window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Revelations, a secluded cult, sits nestled in Idaho's Sawtooth mountains. Jovie, a young nun with limited access to the outside world, discovers hidden evils beyond the church— the truth about a historic nuclear war.</p> <p></p> <p>Hybrid species, survivors, and false prophets fight to control the new world. After a handsome stranger seeks sanctuary within the abbey, they struggle to find freedom in the midst of a wasteland morality conflict. There's just one problem— she's a believer and he isn't.</p>"; 
